	(descr "MEIHUA MHPA3528RGBCT common-anode RGB LED, SMD3528-4P / PLCC-4, body 3.50 x 2.80 x 1.85 mm, top view, water-clear lens, 120 deg. Land pattern reproduced from the manufacturer PACKAGE DIMENSIONS drawing, Issue LPDS-0001719 Rev.2 dated 2018-09-25, Recommended solder pad panel: four 1.20 x 0.95 mm pads, 2.00 mm gap between the left and right columns, 0.40 mm gap between the upper and lower rows, giving pad centres at +/-1.60 mm in X and +/-0.675 mm in Y and a 4.40 x 2.30 mm overall pad envelope. PIN NUMBERING IS TAKEN FROM THE TOP VIEW ON THE SAME PAGE - pin 2 upper left, pin 1 lower left, pin 3 upper right, pin 4 lower right - and pin 1 is the COMMON ANODE. Pin 2 = BLUE cathode, 3 = GREEN cathode, 4 = RED cathode. Do NOT substitute Device:LED_ARGB, which numbers the cathodes 2 = red and 4 = blue and would swap the two colours. ESD: the green and blue dice are rated only 150 V HBM against 2000 V for red.")
	(tags "LED RGB common anode 3528 PLCC-4 SMD status indicator MEIHUA")
